. **# 2 - Create WTP change variables (A-path + B-path)
. **********************************************************************
. 
. **## 2.1 - B-path (after tasting → after info)
. 
.         gen diff_584_b = wtp_3b_info_584 - wtp_2b_584
{txt}(109 missing values generated)

